WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.343 --> 00:00:02.906
♪ It's a ho-ho-ho and a hee-hee-hee ♪

00:00:02.906 --> 00:00:05.628
♪ Listen to us whistle adorably ♪

00:00:05.628 --> 00:00:09.211
(cheerful whistling music)

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:13.727
(lips smack)

00:00:20.827 --> 00:00:23.315
(lips smack)
(elves gasp)

00:00:23.315 --> 00:00:26.300
(elves moan)
(lips smack)

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:29.170
- Elfo, Kissy, no tummy touching!

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:30.790
Kissy, save your lips

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:32.852
for the prepackaged candy assortments!

00:00:32.852 --> 00:00:33.685
(Kissy grunts)

00:00:33.685 --> 00:00:35.640
- Elfo, it's like you don't appreciate

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.420
your assembly line job!

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:40.070
- Yeah, uh, it's kinda
not the one I wanted.

00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:43.921
I'm kinda, not always happy.

00:00:43.921 --> 00:00:45.090
(elves gasp)

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:46.740
- But we're singing!

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:49.440
- Yeah, singing while
you work's not happiness,

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.370
it's mental illness.

00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:52.815
- Waa?

00:00:52.815 --> 00:00:53.780
- Ugh, I'm just,

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:56.010
I'm sick of being happy all the time!

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:57.450
Just once, I wish,

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:59.730
I wish I could go somewhere where,

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:01.583
where people are miserable.

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:06.130
- Take one step further,
you're on your own.

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:08.730
No Elf has ever returned!

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:10.197
Not even Returno!

00:01:10.197 --> 00:01:12.298
- Elfo, you'll die out there.

00:01:12.298 --> 00:01:17.119
- I'd rather die a big death
than live a small life.

00:01:17.119 --> 00:01:19.575
(footsteps click)

00:01:19.575 --> 00:01:22.492
(mysterious music)

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:27.120
Uh, hi, I'm Elfo. (laughs)

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:28.590
What are all your names?

00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:29.980
- What the hell is that?

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:31.481
- An Elf, a magical Elf!

00:01:31.481 --> 00:01:34.130
- Elves haven't been seen in centuries!

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:36.080
- Imagine the possibilities.

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:39.840
With Elf magic, I could
progress far beyond card tricks.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:41.170
(cards rustle)
Ooh!

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:44.623
- A shiny gold Zog to
whoever seizes the Elf!

00:01:44.623 --> 00:01:46.302
(crowd gasping)
(crowd yelling)

00:01:46.302 --> 00:01:47.310
(doors bang)
- Aah!

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:49.570
- Your majesty, it is with much heroism

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:51.560
that I now return Princess Bean,

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:54.033
along with this priceless sack of Elf.

00:01:54.033 --> 00:01:58.350
- Ah, uh, this cold floor
feels good on my concussion.

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:00.050
Hi! I'm Elfo.

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:01.388
- Cram him in a cage!

00:02:01.388 --> 00:02:02.660
(cage bangs)
- It appears

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:05.750
there may be truth to the old
legends regarding the elves.

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:08.520
It seems certain secrets were set down in

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:10.990
the ancient writings of Mephismo.

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:14.330
The essence is that there
is enormously potent magic

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:15.889
in Elf's blood.

00:02:15.889 --> 00:02:17.560
(dramatic violin music)

00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:20.900
- Could this Elf's blood be
the key to my wildest dream?

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:25.560
Might we finally create
the Elixir of Life?

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:27.630
- I don't want to raise your hopes,

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:29.133
but yes, definitely.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:33.403
- Ow.
(blood splats)

00:02:34.902 --> 00:02:37.104
(microscope clicks)

00:02:37.104 --> 00:02:39.880
(door clicks)
- (gasps) Are you okay?

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:42.560
- If I say no, will I seem less manly?

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:45.010
- Oh Elfo, that's not possible.

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:47.400
Why don't you pick on
someone your own size?

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:48.890
Like a bard?

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:51.370
- First of all sweetie, shut up.

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:53.310
I'm not gonna hurt this little guy,

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:55.400
I'm gonna leech the magic out of him!

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:57.607
Don't you want a magic daddy?

00:02:57.607 --> 00:03:00.190
(gears squeak)

00:03:02.678 --> 00:03:05.804
(pig squeals)

00:03:05.804 --> 00:03:07.430
(blood sloshes)

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:09.920
- Did you know that pigs are 80% blood?

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:10.870
- Really?

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:11.843
- Not anymore.

00:03:12.773 --> 00:03:15.190
(calm music)

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:20.640
- I must admit, the quantity of blood

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:23.110
exceeded my expectations.

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:26.210
- So, Elfo is free to go?

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:28.373
- Hmm, for now.

00:03:29.541 --> 00:03:32.510
(patrons laughing)

00:03:32.510 --> 00:03:35.370
- What a naughty night we had!

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:36.280
- I drank so much,

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:38.940
I can't even remember if I drank anything.

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:39.960
I might not have!

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:41.710
- You know it's a great
night when we're still up

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:43.050
to see the plague patrol.

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:44.133
- Morning Princess!

00:03:45.882 --> 00:03:48.830
(upbeat music)
- Oof!

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:50.580
- At last, the Elf.

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:53.863
I've been stalking you,
but you have come to me!

00:03:53.863 --> 00:03:56.550
- Oh, you're a stranger.

00:03:56.550 --> 00:03:57.950
I've heard about you.

00:03:57.950 --> 00:03:59.440
Now where's my candy?

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:02.180
(Elfo screams)
Aa-choo!

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:03.013
- Bless you!

00:04:05.238 --> 00:04:06.573
- Help, help!

00:04:06.573 --> 00:04:08.274
- Elfo, where are you?

00:04:08.274 --> 00:04:10.973
- [Elfo] In here, hurry,
it's really itchy.

00:04:19.063 --> 00:04:22.085
- [Luci] Looks like a
bunch of dead mice, and

00:04:22.085 --> 00:04:23.563
bee-wup!

00:04:23.563 --> 00:04:24.691
- Wow.

00:04:24.691 --> 00:04:27.108
(gem chimes)

00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:32.731
- Ha, nothing to see here!

00:04:32.731 --> 00:04:35.231
(tense music)

00:04:43.126 --> 00:04:45.626
(Elfo grunts)

00:04:47.079 --> 00:04:49.856
(drop pings)
(gem hums)

00:04:49.856 --> 00:04:52.630
- Whoa, am I turning into a god?

00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:55.520
I can feel the power
rising up through my body,

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:56.671
bursting out!
(gem hisses)

00:04:56.671 --> 00:04:58.520
(king belches loudly)

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:00.900
- Aah, I'm not a god!

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.030
I'm not even a healthy man.

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:04.620
Now here's the deal, Touchy.

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:08.120
This spell is only supposed
to need two ingredients.

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:10.289
This vial, and this Elf's blood.

00:05:10.289 --> 00:05:11.963
But it's not working.

00:05:13.203 --> 00:05:14.230
- Hmm, the vial's real.

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:15.550
It's this specimen over here

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:17.480
that requires further examination.

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:18.380
- [King Zøg] What?

00:05:19.427 --> 00:05:21.280
- Huh, fascinating.

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:24.840
I've never felt anything like this before.

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:26.460
This isn't an Elf.

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:27.890
But it's not, not an Elf.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:30.430
He is, however, soft and velvety.

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:32.453
- Thank you, wait, what?

00:05:32.453 --> 00:05:34.240
- What do you mean it's not an Elf?

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:35.940
- Your Elf's blood won't work,

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.986
because this is not an Elf.

00:05:37.986 --> 00:05:41.403
(cheery whistling music)

00:05:46.833 --> 00:05:49.500
(elves gasping)

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:52.487
(package thumps)

00:05:52.487 --> 00:05:54.531
(footsteps click)

00:05:54.531 --> 00:05:55.920
- Here once again, Elfo.

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:58.630
You've made a mockery of the Jolly Code.

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:00.660
Who is that puny little runt?

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:02.297
- Oh that's Luci, he's a demon.

00:06:02.297 --> 00:06:03.640
(elves gasping)

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:05.510
- And who is that?

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:07.249
- Oh that's Bean, she's a human.

00:06:07.249 --> 00:06:08.910
(elves gasping)

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:12.800
- Ugh, humans bring nothing
but treachery and pain.

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:15.163
- Oh c'mon, Dad, what am I?

00:06:15.163 --> 00:06:18.040
- Well, I was waiting to tell
you until after I was dead,

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:19.368
so I wouldn't have to tell ya!

00:06:19.368 --> 00:06:21.158
It's hard to say, so,

00:06:21.158 --> 00:06:24.290
I'll let this needlepoint
do the talking for me.

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:25.910
Your mom made it.

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:29.111
Truth is, you're only
half-Elf, you also have--

00:06:29.111 --> 00:06:31.790
(Elfo grunts)
(crowd screaming)

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:34.540
(paper splashes)

00:06:35.598 --> 00:06:36.600
(footsteps click)

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:39.341
- How dare you threaten
these innocent folk?

00:06:39.341 --> 00:06:40.880
I mean, look at this guy.

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:43.230
Show him what's under your hat, buddy.

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:46.010
It's not just a kitten,
it's a sleeping kitten.

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:48.380
These guys are totally defenseless.

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:52.657
- Not totally.
(dramatic music)

00:06:52.657 --> 00:06:53.679
(stone bangs)
- Ugh!

00:06:53.679 --> 00:06:55.382
(armor squeaks)
(body thuds)

00:06:55.382 --> 00:06:57.564
(dramatic music)

00:06:57.564 --> 00:07:00.314
(arrow whooshes)

00:07:01.286 --> 00:07:06.072
(girl grunts)
(bubbles ping)

00:07:06.072 --> 00:07:09.330
(arrows whoosh)
(arrows thud)

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:10.400
- [All] Oh, yeah!

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:11.830
- We are a team.

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:13.180
- I always thought so.

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:14.142
- Really?

00:07:14.142 --> 00:07:14.990
(arrow thuds)
(Elfo moans)

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:15.823
- No, Elfo!

00:07:17.358 --> 00:07:18.191
(arrow clicks)

00:07:18.191 --> 00:07:20.050
Elfo speak to me, Elfo!

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:20.883
- Who did that?

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:25.950
- Now just keep holding on,
okay, just keep holding on.

00:07:27.099 --> 00:07:28.516
- Ugh, it's okay.

00:07:29.743 --> 00:07:30.973
It's okay Bean.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:35.557
I always wanted to go out
while I'm still young and hot.

00:07:35.557 --> 00:07:38.390
(footsteps click)

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:40.240
- Sorry, it's just,

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:41.810
you have snot, like,

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:42.910
all over your face.

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:44.313
- Ah thanks, yeah.

00:07:45.318 --> 00:07:48.030
(girl gasps)

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:49.940
This is Elf's blood.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:51.573
Real Elf's blood!

00:07:51.573 --> 00:07:52.406
- You don't think it'd
actually work, do you?

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:56.870
- No, probably not.

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:58.823
But I guess it doesn't hurt to try.

00:08:01.447 --> 00:08:03.691
(blood pings)
(gem hums)

00:08:03.691 --> 00:08:05.880
(ethereal music)

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.830
- There's only one drop of blood.

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:09.340
I don't know who to choose!

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:10.830
- I don't want to get your hopes up.

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:12.730
It'll probably fizzle out like before.

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:15.180
So just close your eyes
and don't think too much.

00:08:22.279 --> 00:08:24.696
(lips smack)

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:28.658
- Whatever happens, happens.

00:08:28.658 --> 00:08:32.241
(hopeful orchestral music)

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.230
- Rest in peace, buddy.

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:45.244
Sorry they had to bury
you in this aquarium.

00:08:45.244 --> 00:08:47.827
(somber music)

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:51.630
- Oof!
(body thuds)

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:54.950
- [Crowd] Queen fight,
Queen fight, Queen fight!

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:56.760
- Your Highness, do something!

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:58.500
- Ladies, ladies, come on!

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:01.292
I'm much more embarrassed
than I am aroused.

00:09:01.292 --> 00:09:02.626
- Oof!
- Oof!

00:09:02.626 --> 00:09:05.376
(dramatic music)

00:09:07.758 --> 00:09:08.854
(glass clatters)

00:09:08.854 --> 00:09:11.521
(crowd gasping)

00:09:15.978 --> 00:09:19.042
(crowd sighs)

00:09:19.042 --> 00:09:21.709
(body splashes)

00:09:27.101 --> 00:09:32.101
(water sloshes)
(waves hiss)

